wise type, in any app, in 100 languages. The filler comes out, the spelling gets fixed, and what lands on the page is what you meant.\"}]\n16:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-5 text-[15px] font-medium text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"See what it does\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":1.8,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"}]}]]}]\n1b:T9cf,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are the main VoiceOS features?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"VoiceOS includes system-wide AI dictation, voice editing for selected text, screen-aware questions, web search, custom vocabulary and writing context, plus Agent Mode for supported connected actions. It runs on Mac and Windows and is designed to keep important actions reviewable before completion.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is VoiceOS only a dictation app?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Dictation Mode is one part of VoiceOS. Edit Mode changes existing text from a spoken instruction, and Agent Mode can use screen context, answer questions, search, and prepare actions through supported integrations. The product is designed around the full task rather than transcription alone.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can VoiceOS control every app on my computer?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"VoiceOS can dictate into standard text fields across many desktop apps, while Agent Mode supports specific actions through screen context and connected services. It does not promise universal command-level control of every interface. Check the App Store and test the exact workflows you depend on.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does VoiceOS work on Windows as well as Mac?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. VoiceOS provides desktop apps for macOS and Windows. The website selects an installer based on the visitor’s operating system, and the alternate desktop download remains available. App behavior can depend on operating-system permissions and the controls exposed by each destination app.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does VoiceOS send actions without asking?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"VoiceOS is designed to present consequential actions for review before completion. You can inspect, edit, confirm, or cancel the proposed work. The exact confirmation flow depends on the action and connected service, but maintaining user control is a core part of Agent Mode.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I get started with VoiceOS?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Download the Mac or Windows app and choose a plan. Begin with dictation in a familiar text field, then use Edit Mode, ask a question about your screen, and connect one supported integration. Using real tasks will show whether VoiceOS reduces corrections and context switching in your workflow.\"}}]}17:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-20 md:mt-28\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$1b\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-3xl border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50/70 p-6 md:p-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-blue-700\",\"children\":\"The short answer\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800\",\"children\":\"VoiceOS is an AI voice assistant for Mac and Windows with three connected capabilities: Dictation Mode turns speech into polished text, Edit Mode reshapes selected writing, and Agent Mode uses screen context to answer questions and prepare supported actions across your apps. Important actions remain reviewable before they are completed.\"}]]}],\"$L1c\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-20 md:mt-28\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"fp-privacy-card relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-[56px] px-6 py-14 text-center md:rounded-[96px] md:py-0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-3xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"section-title text-[48px] font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-white\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1d\",\"number0\",{\"value\":1169420}],\" hours saved for our users\"]}]}]}]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{}]\n20:T544,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"WakoAI Inc.\",\"legalName\":\"WakoAI Inc.\",\"alternateName\":\"VoiceOS\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceos.com\",\"email\":\"support@voiceos.com\",\"description\":\"WakoAI Inc. builds VoiceOS, an AI voice agent and system-wide dictation app for Mac and Windows.\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/voiceOsLogo.png\"},\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"VoiceOS\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceos.com\"},\"founder\":[{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/authors/jonah-daian#person\",\"name\":\"Jonah Daian\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/authors/jonah-daian\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/authors/kai-brokering#person\",\"name\":\"Kai Brokering\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/authors/kai-brokering\"}],\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/voice-os/\",\"https://x.com/VoiceOSApp\",\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/voiceos\",\"https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/PP3-voiceos-the-siri-for-productivity\",\"https://docs.voiceos.com/\"],\"knowsAbout\":[\"AI dictation\",\"voice agents\",\"desktop productivity\",\"voice-to-action workflows\",\"hands-free computing\",\"workflow automation\"],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer support\",\"email\":\"support@voiceos.com\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\",\"Japanese\"]}]}2:[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"className\":\"dm_mono_a086b4ea-module__pIDXBa__variable\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"head\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$20\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebSite\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://www.voiceos.com/#website\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.voiceos.com\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"VoiceOS\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"VoiceOS is a voice operating system that turns voice to action. The AI voice assistant for Mac and Windows: dictate, send messages, search the web, and automate apps by voice. Try it free.\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":[\\\"en\\\",\\\"ja\\\"],\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://www.voiceos.com/#organization\\\"}}\"}}],[\"$\",\"link\",null,{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"type\":\"text/plain\",\"href\":\"/llms.txt\",\"title\":\"LLM-readable site description\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",null,{\"rel\":\"describedby\",\"type\":\"text/plain\",\"href\":\"/llms-full.txt\",\"title\":\"Full LLM-readable VoiceOS documentation\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",null,{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"href\":\"/agents.md\",\"title\":\"VoiceOS agent instructions\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",null,{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"href\":\"/pricing.md\",\"title\":\"VoiceOS machine-readable pricing\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",null,{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"href\":\"/index.md\",\"title\":\"VoiceOS markdown homepage\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",null,{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"type\":\"application/json\",\"href\":\"/.well-known/agent-card.json\",\"title\":\"VoiceOS agent card\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",null,{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"type\":\"application/rss+xml\",\"href\":\"/rss.xml\",\"title\":\"VoiceOS Blog RSS Feed\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",null,{\"rel\":\"preload\",\"as\":\"image\",\"href\":\"/skyCloudsHero-mobile.webp\",\"media\":\"(max-width: 767px)\",\"fetchPriority\":\"high\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",null,{\"rel\":\"preload\",\"as\":\"image\",\"href\":\"/skyCloudsHero.webp\",\"media\":\"(min-width: 768px)\",\"fetchPriority\":\"high\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L21\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L22\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L23\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L24\",null,{\"domainsConfig\":{\"refer\":\"refer.voiceos.com\"},\"cookieOptions\":{\"domain\":\".voiceos.com\"}}],[\"$\",\"$8\",null,{\"fallback\":null,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L25\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L28\",null,{}]]}],\"$L29\"]}]}]}]]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 space-y-16\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"section\",\"What can VoiceOS do?\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"section-title text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-950 md:text-4xl\",\"children\":\"What can VoiceOS do?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-8 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"VoiceOS gives your desktop a voice layer that works where the task is already happening. Instead of opening a separate chatbot, copying context into it, and moving the answer back, you can speak from the app in front of you. The product decides whether the request is best handled as text, an edit, a question about the screen, or a supported action that needs your review.\",{\"children\":\"VoiceOS gives your desktop a voice layer that works where the task is already happening. Instead of opening a separate chatbot, copying context into it, and moving the answer back, you can speak from the app in front of you. The product decides whether the request is best handled as text, an edit, a question about the screen, or a supported action that needs your review.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"The simplest workflow is dictation. Put the cursor in an email, document, message, prompt, issue, or code comment and speak naturally. VoiceOS removes verbal clutter, adds punctuation, and turns the thought into writing suited to the destination. From there, you can select text and ask for a revision, ask a question about the current screen, or use Agent Mode to prepare the next step.\",{\"children\":\"The simplest workflow is dictation. Put the cursor in an email, document, message, prompt, issue, or code comment and speak naturally. VoiceOS removes verbal clutter, adds punctuation, and turns the thought into writing suited to the destination. From there, you can select text and ask for a revision, ask a question about the current screen, or use Agent Mode to prepare the next step.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 grid gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 md:grid-cols-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"Dictate polished text into standard fields across Mac and Windows apps.\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[0.65em] h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-blue-600\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Dictate polished text into standard fields across Mac and Windows apps.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Rewrite selected text by describing the result you want.\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[0.65em] h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-blue-600\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Rewrite selected text by describing the result you want.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Ask questions that depend on the screen in front of you.\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[0.65em] h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-blue-600\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Ask questions that depend on the screen in front of you.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Search the web without breaking the current workflow.\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[0.65em] h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-blue-600\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Search the web without breaking the current workflow.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Prepare supported messages, calendar items, documents, and other connected actions.\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-700\",\"children\":[\"$L2a\",\"$L2b\"]}]]}],\"$undefined\"]}],\"$L2c\",\"$L2d\",\"$L2e\",\"$L2f\",\"$L30\",\"$L31\"],\"$L32\"]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[0.65em] h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-blue-600\"}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Prepare supported messages, calendar items, documents, and other connected actions.\"}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"section\",\"How does VoiceOS Agent Mode work?\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"section-title text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-950 md:text-4xl\",\"children\":\"How does VoiceOS Agent Mode work?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-8 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Agent Mode is the difference between voice as an input method and voice as a way to direct work. A traditional dictation tool returns text. An agent can interpret the outcome you described, use available context, choose an appropriate capability, and assemble a proposed result. You stay in the loop before consequential work is sent, created, or shared.\",{\"children\":\"Agent Mode is the difference between voice as an input method and voice as a way to direct work. A traditional dictation tool returns text. An agent can interpret the outcome you described, use available context, choose an appropriate capability, and assemble a proposed result. You stay in the loop before consequential work is sent, created, or shared.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"For example, while reading an email you might ask VoiceOS to summarize the request and draft a concise reply. While looking at a dashboard, you can ask what changed and turn the explanation into a message for your team. With a supported service connected, you can ask it to prepare a calendar event or a cross-app follow-up. The exact capabilities depend on your integrations and permissions, but the interaction remains consistent: describe the outcome, inspect the proposal, and confirm it when it is right.\",{\"children\":\"For example, while reading an email you might ask VoiceOS to summarize the request and draft a concise reply. While looking at a dashboard, you can ask what changed and turn the explanation into a message for your team. With a supported service connected, you can ask it to prepare a calendar event or a cross-app follow-up. The exact capabilities depend on your integrations and permissions, but the interaction remains consistent: describe the outcome, inspect the proposal, and confirm it when it is right.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"This approach removes the manual glue between apps without pretending that judgment should be automated. VoiceOS is intended to handle context gathering, drafting, formatting, and orchestration while you decide what is accurate, appropriate, and ready to leave your computer.\",{\"children\":\"This approach removes the manual glue between apps without pretending that judgment should be automated. VoiceOS is intended to handle context gathering, drafting, formatting, and orchestration while you decide what is accurate, appropriate, and ready to leave your computer.\"}]]}],\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"section\",\"How is VoiceOS different from a dictation app?\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"section-title text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-950 md:text-4xl\",\"children\":\"How is VoiceOS different from a dictation app?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-8 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Dictation apps solve an important but narrow problem: they make words appear faster than you can type them. VoiceOS includes that capability, then keeps going. It can work with existing text through Edit Mode and with visible information through Agent Mode. That matters because most knowledge work does not end when a paragraph appears in a text field.\",{\"children\":\"Dictation apps solve an important but narrow problem: they make words appear faster than you can type them. VoiceOS includes that capability, then keeps going. It can work with existing text through Edit Mode and with visible information through Agent Mode. That matters because most knowledge work does not end when a paragraph appears in a text field.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"Consider a customer email. Dictation can help you write the response, but you may first need to understand a long thread, find a detail, match the tone, and verify a date. A voice assistant can help with those surrounding steps from the same interface. The gain is not only words per minute; it is fewer interruptions between understanding, deciding, writing, and acting.\",{\"children\":\"Consider a customer email. Dictation can help you write the response, but you may first need to understand a long thread, find a detail, match the tone, and verify a date. A voice assistant can help with those surrounding steps from the same interface. The gain is not only words per minute; it is fewer interruptions between understanding, deciding, writing, and acting.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"VoiceOS also treats context as part of quality. The right output for Slack is usually shorter than the right output for a proposal. A message to a colleague can sound different from an executive update. By working where the writing will be used, VoiceOS can produce a more useful first draft and reduce the correction loop that often erases the time saved by raw transcription.\",{\"children\":\"VoiceOS also treats context as part of quality. The right output for Slack is usually shorter than the right output for a proposal. A message to a colleague can sound different from an executive update. By working where the writing will be used, VoiceOS can produce a more useful first draft and reduce the correction loop that often erases the time saved by raw transcription.\"}]]}],\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\"]}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Which apps does VoiceOS work with?\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"section-title text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-950 md:text-4xl\",\"children\":\"Which apps does VoiceOS work with?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-8 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Dictation and editing are designed to work in standard text fields across macOS and Windows, including browsers, email clients, chat tools, documents, note apps, project-management software, and code editors. If you can place a normal text cursor in an app, that is the first place to test VoiceOS. Protected fields and unusual custom controls can behave differently, so checking compatibility with your critical software is important.\",{\"children\":\"Dictation and editing are designed to work in standard text fields across macOS and Windows, including browsers, email clients, chat tools, documents, note apps, project-management software, and code editors. If you can place a normal text cursor in an app, that is the first place to test VoiceOS. Protected fields and unusual custom controls can behave differently, so checking compatibility with your critical software is important.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"Agent Mode adds another layer through screen context and connected services. The VoiceOS App Store lists current integrations and the actions each one supports. Capabilities can include preparing messages, working with calendars, retrieving information, or creating content in supported destinations. You choose which services to connect rather than granting blanket access to everything on your computer.\",{\"children\":\"Agent Mode adds another layer through screen context and connected services. The VoiceOS App Store lists current integrations and the actions each one supports. Capabilities can include preparing messages, working with calendars, retrieving information, or creating content in supported destinations. You choose which services to connect rather than granting blanket access to everything on your computer.\"}]]}],\"$undefined\",[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3\",\"children\":[\"$L33\",\"$L34\"]}]]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"section\",\"How does VoiceOS keep voice actions under control?\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"section-title text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-950 md:text-4xl\",\"children\":\"How does VoiceOS keep voice actions under control?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-8 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Speed is useful only when the result remains trustworthy. VoiceOS separates preparation from confirmation for important actions. The assistant can draft the message, assemble the event, or plan the requested work, but you can inspect what will happen before it is completed. If something is wrong, edit the proposal or cancel it without sending the mistake downstream.\",{\"children\":\"Speed is useful only when the result remains trustworthy. VoiceOS separates preparation from confirmation for important actions. The assistant can draft the message, assemble the event, or plan the requested work, but you can inspect what will happen before it is completed. If something is wrong, edit the proposal or cancel it without sending the mistake downstream.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"Permissions are also scoped by the operating system and the services you connect. Microphone access enables speech input. Accessibility permissions support interaction with desktop text fields. Screen context and integrations are used for the features that require them. Teams evaluating VoiceOS should review the current security page, retention choices, and administrative controls against their own policies before deployment.\",{\"children\":\"Permissions are also scoped by the operating system and the services you connect. Microphone access enables speech input. Accessibility permissions support interaction with desktop text fields. Screen context and integrations are used for the features that require them. Teams evaluating VoiceOS should review the current security page, retention choices, and administrative controls against their own policies before deployment.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"The goal is a practical balance: less manual coordination, visible intent, and a human decision at the point where an action becomes consequential. That makes Agent Mode useful for daily work without asking users to trust an invisible automation chain.\",{\"children\":\"The goal is a practical balance: less manual coordination, visible intent, and a human decision at the point where an action becomes consequential. That makes Agent Mode useful for daily work without asking users to trust an invisible automation chain.\"}]]}],\"$undefined\",[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3\",\"children\":[\"$L35\"]}]]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"section\",\"Who is VoiceOS for?\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"section-title text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-950 md:text-4xl\",\"children\":\"Who is VoiceOS for?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-8 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"VoiceOS is useful for people whose work moves through language and software all day: founders, developers, operators, sales teams, support teams, students, writers, and anyone who repeatedly turns thoughts into messages, documents, prompts, plans, or app updates. It is especially valuable when the cost of the work comes from context switching rather than from one difficult task.\",{\"children\":\"VoiceOS is useful for people whose work moves through language and software all day: founders, developers, operators, sales teams, support teams, students, writers, and anyone who repeatedly turns thoughts into messages, documents, prompts, plans, or app updates. It is especially valuable when the cost of the work comes from context switching rather than from one difficult task.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"Developers can dictate prompts, issues, documentation, and code-review notes without leaving the editor. Customer-facing teams can draft replies from visible context and keep a consistent tone. Managers can turn a spoken update into a structured message or meeting follow-up. People who experience fatigue or discomfort from heavy typing may also benefit from moving more language work to voice, although specialized accessibility needs should always be tested directly.\",{\"children\":\"Developers can dictate prompts, issues, documentation, and code-review notes without leaving the editor. Customer-facing teams can draft replies from visible context and keep a consistent tone. Managers can turn a spoken update into a structured message or meeting follow-up. People who experience fatigue or discomfort from heavy typing may also benefit from moving more language work to voice, although specialized accessibility needs should always be tested directly.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"You do not need to replace the keyboard and mouse. Voice works best as another input layer: use it for intent, drafting, revision, and multi-step direction; keep precise manual controls for the moments that demand them. The product is designed to shorten the distance between deciding what should happen and having a reviewable result ready.\",{\"children\":\"You do not need to replace the keyboard and mouse. Voice works best as another input layer: use it for intent, drafting, revision, and multi-step direction; keep precise manual controls for the moments that demand them. The product is designed to shorten the distance between deciding what should happen and having a reviewable result ready.\"}]]}],\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"section\",\"How do you get started with VoiceOS?\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"section-title text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-950 md:text-4xl\",\"children\":\"How do you get started with VoiceOS?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-8 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Install the Mac or Windows desktop app, grant the permissions required for the modes you plan to use, and begin with a low-risk writing task. Dictate a note, an email draft, or a prompt in an app you know well. This establishes how the shortcut, microphone, and text insertion feel in your normal environment.\",{\"children\":\"Install the Mac or Windows desktop app, grant the permissions required for the modes you plan to use, and begin with a low-risk writing task. Dictate a note, an email draft, or a prompt in an app you know well. This establishes how the shortcut, microphone, and text insertion feel in your normal environment.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"Next, select a piece of text and ask Edit Mode to shorten it, change the tone, or turn it into a list. Then try a screen-aware question on a document or webpage. Finally, connect one supported service and test a small Agent Mode workflow with confirmation enabled. Evaluating the product in layers makes it clear which part saves time and where your own permissions or app setup need adjustment.\",{\"children\":\"Next, select a piece of text and ask Edit Mode to shorten it, change the tone, or turn it into a list. Then try a screen-aware question on a document or webpage. Finally, connect one supported service and test a small Agent Mode workflow with confirmation enabled. Evaluating the product in layers makes it clear which part saves time and where your own permissions or app setup need adjustment.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"To evaluate VoiceOS, use complete workflows rather than isolated demo sentences: start with the context you receive, produce the writing, prepare the follow-up, and count how many app switches and manual steps remain.\",{\"children\":\"To evaluate VoiceOS, use complete workflows rather than isolated demo sentences: start with the context you receive, produce the writing, prepare the follow-up, and count how many app switches and manual steps remain.\"}]]}],\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\"]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"features-faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"section-title text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-950 md:text-4xl\",\"children\":\"VoiceOS feature FAQ\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"What are the main VoiceOS features?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer font-medium text-gray-950\",\"children\":\"What are the main VoiceOS features?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"VoiceOS includes system-wide AI dictation, voice editing for selected text, screen-aware questions, web search, custom vocabulary and writing context, plus Agent Mode for supported connected actions. It runs on Mac and Windows and is designed to keep important actions reviewable before completion.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Is VoiceOS only a dictation app?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer font-medium text-gray-950\",\"children\":\"Is VoiceOS only a dictation app?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"No. Dictation Mode is one part of VoiceOS. Edit Mode changes existing text from a spoken instruction, and Agent Mode can use screen context, answer questions, search, and prepare actions through supported integrations. The product is designed around the full task rather than transcription alone.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Can VoiceOS control every app on my computer?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer font-medium text-gray-950\",\"children\":\"Can VoiceOS control every app on my computer?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"VoiceOS can dictate into standard text fields across many desktop apps, while Agent Mode supports specific actions through screen context and connected services. It does not promise universal command-level control of every interface. Check the App Store and test the exact workflows you depend on.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Does VoiceOS work on Windows as well as Mac?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer font-medium text-gray-950\",\"children\":\"Does VoiceOS work on Windows as well as Mac?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"Yes. VoiceOS provides desktop apps for macOS and Windows. The website selects an installer based on the visitor’s operating system, and the alternate desktop download remains available. App behavior can depend on operating-system permissions and the controls exposed by each destination app.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Does VoiceOS send actions without asking?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer font-medium text-gray-950\",\"children\":\"Does VoiceOS send actions without asking?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"VoiceOS is designed to present consequential actions for review before completion. You can inspect, edit, confirm, or cancel the proposed work. The exact confirmation flow depends on the action and connected service, but maintaining user control is a core part of Agent Mode.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"How do I get started with VoiceOS?\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5\",\"children\":[\"$L36\",\"$L37\"]}]]}]]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer font-medium text-gray-950\",\"children\":\"How do I get started with VoiceOS?\"}]\n37:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"Download the Mac or Windows app and choose a plan. Begin with dictation in a familiar text field, then use Edit Mode, ask a question about your screen, and connect one supported integration. Using real tasks will show whether VoiceOS reduces corrections and context switching in your workflow.\"}]\n38:I[77105,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2kb52na2e7ces.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1xfsu92iq1h9m.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3x6-_ejf1r1x0.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2g2jfeybanwrx.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/35rx1_qn9m74v.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0z6qqa_pcb2c9.js\"],\"default\"]\n33:[\"$\",\"$L38\",\"/app-store\",{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"href\":\"/app-store\",\"locale\":\"$undefined\",\"localeCookie\":{\"name\":\"NEXT_LOCALE\",\"sameSite\":\"lax\"},\"className\":\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 hover:border-gray-300\",\"children\":\"Browse the VoiceOS App Store\"}]\n34:[\"$\",\"$L38\",\"/guide/build-mcp-integration\",{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"href\":\"/guide/build-mcp-integration\",\"locale\":\"$undefined\",\"localeCookie\":\"$33:props:localeCookie\",\"className\":\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 hover:border-gray-300\",\"children\":\"Build an MCP integration\"}]\n35:[\"$\",\"$L38\",\"/security\",{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"href\":\"/security\",\"locale\":\"$undefined\",\"localeCookie\":\"$33:props:localeCookie\",\"className\":\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 hover:border-gray-300\",\"children\":\"Read VoiceOS security information\"}]\n39:I[75696,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2kb52na2e7ces.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1xfsu92iq1h9m.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3x6-_ejf1r1x0.js\"],\"default\"]\n3b:I[62549,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2kb52na2e7ces.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1xfsu92iq1h9m.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3x6-_ejf1r1x0.js\"],\"default\"]\n3:[\"$\",\"$L39\",null,{\"formats\":\"$undefined\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"messages\":{\"CTA\":{\"ctaPrefix\":\"Press\",\"ctaSuffix\":\"and start speaking.\",\"subheading\":\"Let \u003cbold\u003eyour voice\u003c/bold\u003e do the \u003cbold\u003ework\u003c/bold\u003e.\",\"downloadForMac\":\"Download for Mac\",\"downloadForWindows\":\"Download for Windows\"},\"MobilePage\":{\"title\":\"Mobile is coming soon\",\"metaDescription\":\"VoiceOS is on Mac and Windows today. Join the waitlist to get notified when VoiceOS launches on mobile.\",\"description\":\"VoiceOS is currently available on \u003cstrong\u003eMac\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eWindows\u003c/strong\u003e.\",\"notify\":\"Get notified when we launch on mobile.\",\"placeholder\":\"Enter your email\",\"submitButton\":\"Join Waitlist\",\"processing\":\"Processing...\",\"joined\":\"Joined!\",\"successTitle\":\"You're on the list!\",\"successBody\":\"We sent Mac and Windows download links to your inbox. You're still on the mobile waitlist, too.\",\"invalidEmail\":\"Please enter a valid email.\",\"emailSendError\":\"You're on the mobile waitlist, but we couldn't send the desktop download links. Please try again.\",\"backToHome\":\"Back to home\"},\"DictationPage\":{\"metaTitle\":\"Voice Dictation for Mac and Windows - VoiceOS\",\"metaDescription\":\"Talk anywhere you would otherwise type. VoiceOS turns speech into clean, formatted writing in any app, in 100 languages, without the filler words or typos.\",\"title\":\"Talk instead of \u003caccent\u003etyping\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"subtitle\":\"VoiceOS turns what you say into finished writing, in whatever app your cursor is already in.\",\"chip\":\"Mac and Windows\",\"speedTitle\":\"\u003caccent\u003e4x faster\u003c/accent\u003e than typing\",\"speedSubtitle\":\"Most people type around 55 words a minute. Speaking runs closer to 220, and VoiceOS keeps up with every word.\",\"editsTitle\":\"Say it messy, \u003caccent\u003eit lands clean\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"editsSubtitle\":\"Speak the way you actually think. VoiceOS drops the filler, fixes the spelling, learns the names you use, and writes down what you meant.\",\"toneTitle\":\"It writes to fit \u003caccent\u003ewhere it lands\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"toneSubtitle\":\"Say it once. VoiceOS reads the app your cursor is in and writes to match, so the same thought arrives as a proper email, a quick text, or a clean list of notes.\",\"toneMailGreeting\":\"Hi John,\",\"toneMailBody\":\"I'll send the deck over tonight.\",\"toneMailClosing\":\"Best,\",\"toneMailName\":\"Steve\",\"toneMessagesText\":\"sending the deck tonight\",\"toneNotionTitle\":\"Today\",\"toneNotionItem1\":\"Send John the deck tonight\",\"toneNotionItem2\":\"Add the Q3 numbers to slide four\",\"toneNotionItem3\":\"Ask Priya for the revenue chart\",\"langTitle\":\"Speak the language you \u003caccent\u003ethink in\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"langSubtitle\":\"Over 100 languages. Nothing to switch, nothing to set.\",\"spellTitle\":\"It spells them \u003caccent\u003eyour way\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"spellSubtitle\":\"Names, products, acronyms. Say them however they come out and VoiceOS writes them the way you write them.\",\"spellSaid1\":\"“wako AI”\",\"spellWrote1\":\"WakoAI\",\"spellSaid2\":\"“super base”\",\"spellWrote2\":\"Supabase\",\"spellSaid3\":\"“kuber netties”\",\"spellWrote3\":\"Kubernetes\",\"spellSaid4\":\"“oh kay ars”\",\"spellWrote4\":\"OKRs\"},\"AgentMode\":{\"title\":\"Voice + Agent Mode\",\"subtitle\":\"Ask VoiceOS and let it do it for you\",\"whatYouSee\":\"WHAT YOU SEE\",\"whatAgentDoes\":\"WHAT AGENT DOES\",\"senderName\":\"John Doe\",\"senderSubject\":\"Project Sync Meeting\",\"emailBody\":\"Hey, just checking if you're still free to meet tomorrow at 2pm? We need to go over the Q3 roadmap.\",\"voiceInstruction\":\"\\\"Reply saying I can't go\\\"\",\"draftCreated\":\"Draft Created\",\"draftGreeting\":\"Hi John,\",\"draftBody\":\"I won't be able to make it tomorrow at 2pm. Can we reschedule?\",\"instant\":\"Instant\",\"accurate\":\"Accurate\",\"useAgentModeTo\":\"Use Agent Mode to...\",\"exampleReschedule\":\"\\\"Politely reschedule the meeting\\\"\",\"exampleProfessional\":\"\\\"Make this more professional\\\"\",\"exampleThankYou\":\"\\\"Write a thank you email\\\"\",\"exampleFixGrammar\":\"\\\"Fix grammar and shorten this\\\"\",\"andMore\":\"\u0026 much more\"},\"PricingPage\":{\"metaTitle\":\"Pricing - VoiceOS\",\"metaDescription\":\"VoiceOS pricing. Start with a 7-day free trial of Pro. Unlimited dictation and Agent Mode on Mac and Windows. Cancel anytime.\",\"compareTitle\":\"Compare plans\",\"compareSubtitle\":\"Compare the plans available to new customers.\",\"planPro\":\"Pro\",\"planEnterprise\":\"Enterprise\",\"featureColumn\":\"Feature\",\"included\":\"Included\",\"notIncluded\":\"Not included\",\"valueUnlimited\":\"Unlimited\",\"valueComingSoon\":\"Coming soon\",\"valueEnforced\":\"Enforced\",\"groupPlatforms\":\"Platforms\",\"rowMac\":\"macOS\",\"rowWindows\":\"Windows\",\"rowMobile\":\"iPhone and Android\",\"rowEveryApp\":\"Works in every app you already use\",\"groupAgent\":\"Agent Mode\",\"rowAgentUsage\":\"Agent Mode sessions\",\"rowIntegrations\":\"App integrations\",\"rowMcp\":\"Your own MCP servers\",\"rowWebSearch\":\"Web search with sources\",\"rowScreen\":\"Screen awareness\",\"rowScheduling\":\"Reminders and scheduling\",\"rowConfirm\":\"Action confirmation\",\"groupDictation\":\"Dictation Mode\",\"rowDictationUsage\":\"Dictation sessions\",\"rowLanguages\":\"Languages\",\"value100Languages\":\"100 languages\",\"rowStyles\":\"Polish styles\",\"rowVocabulary\":\"Custom vocabulary and replacements\",\"rowEditText\":\"Edit selected text by voice\",\"groupPrivacy\":\"Privacy and security\",\"rowPrivateMode\":\"Private Mode\",\"rowLocalTranscripts\":\"Transcripts stored on your device\",\"rowSso\":\"SSO / SAML\",\"faqTitle\":\"Frequently asked questions\",\"faqQ1\":\"Is there a free trial?\",\"faqA1\":\"Yes. Every new account starts with a \u003cb\u003e7-day free trial of Pro\u003c/b\u003e. A card is required at checkout, and you can cancel any time before the trial ends. One trial per email address.\",\"faqQ2\":\"What happens when the trial ends?\",\"faqA2\":\"Your plan starts automatically on the billing cycle you chose at checkout, monthly or annual, at the price shown there. When the trial begins we email you \u003cb\u003ethe date and the amount\u003c/b\u003e of that first charge, so nothing arrives as a surprise.\",\"faqQ3\":\"Can I cancel anytime?\",\"faqA3\":\"Yes. Cancel from \u003cb\u003eSettings, then Billing\u003c/b\u003e inside the app. You keep Pro until the end of the period you have already paid for.\",\"faqQ4\":\"What happens to my account if I cancel?\",\"faqA4\":\"After cancellation, when your paid Pro period ends, existing accounts have limited access: 100 dictation sessions and 25 Agent Mode sessions per week. This is not a plan available at sign-up.\",\"faqQ5\":\"Do you offer discounts?\",\"faqA5\":\"Students get \u003cb\u003e50% off Pro while enrolled\u003c/b\u003e, and we re-check enrollment once a year. Builders shipping their own VoiceOS integrations can apply for \u003cb\u003e50% off Pro\u003c/b\u003e. Both are short application forms that we read by hand.\",\"faqQ6\":\"What is the difference between monthly and annual?\",\"faqA6\":\"Annual is billed once a year and works out to \u003cb\u003e60% less per month\u003c/b\u003e than paying monthly. The prices on the cards above update to your region automatically.\",\"faqQ7\":\"Which platforms does VoiceOS run on?\",\"faqA7\":\"\u003cb\u003eMac and Windows\u003c/b\u003e today. Mobile is on the way and you can join the waitlist from the mobile page.\",\"faqQ8\":\"Do you have plans for teams?\",\"faqA8\":\"VoiceOS offers Enterprise for teams. Contact us to confirm available administration, retention, and identity-provider requirements in your agreement.\",\"freeNote\":\"After cancellation, when your paid Pro period ends, existing accounts have limited access: 100 dictation sessions and 25 Agent Mode sessions per week. This is not a plan available at sign-up.\",\"signupNote\":\"New customers start with a 7-day free trial of Pro or contact us about Enterprise. A card is required. One trial per email address.\",\"afterCancellationTitle\":\"After Pro ends\",\"valueContactSales\":\"Contact sales\",\"valuePerAction\":\"Varies by action\"},\"Dictation\":{\"dictationMode\":\"Dictation Mode\",\"dictationDescription\":\"Writes \u003cbold\u003ewhat you meant\u003c/bold\u003e, not what you said.\",\"youSay\":\"You say\",\"voiceosWrites\":\"VoiceOS writes\",\"dictationInput\":\"\\\"Can you send me that form by today... I mean tomorrow?\\\"\",\"dictationOutput\":\"Can you send me that form by tomorrow?\",\"askMode\":\"Agent Mode\",\"askYouSay\":\"You say\",\"askDescription\":\"Ask VoiceOS and let it \u003cbold\u003ewrite for you\u003c/bold\u003e.\",\"askInput\":\"\\\"Reply I can't but ask to reschedule\\\"\",\"askOutputGreeting\":\"Hi John,\",\"askOutputBody\":\"I won't be able to make it tomorrow at 2pm. Can we reschedule?\",\"askOutputClosing\":\"Best,\",\"askOutputName\":\"Steve\"},\"Style\":{\"soundsLikeYouTitle\":\"Sounds \u003cbold\u003eJust Like You\u003c/bold\u003e\",\"soundsLikeYouDescription\":\"VoiceOS \u003cbold\u003eadapts\u003c/bold\u003e to match how you \u003cbold\u003enaturally communicate\u003c/bold\u003e\",\"youSay\":\"You say\",\"voiceosWrites\":\"VoiceOS writes\",\"inputThanks\":\"\\\"thanks\\\"\",\"outputMail\":\"Thanks.\",\"outputSlack\":\"Thanks!\",\"outputMessages\":\"thanks\",\"smartFormatsTitle\":\"\u003cbold\u003eSmart\u003c/bold\u003e Formats\",\"smartFormatsDescription\":\"VoiceOS \u003cbold\u003eautomatically formats\u003c/bold\u003e based on \u003cbold\u003econtext\u003c/bold\u003e\",\"smartFormatsInput\":\"\\\"Reply with demo link\\\"\",\"dictationDemoAutoFormatsTitle\":\"Auto \u003cbold\u003eFormats\u003c/bold\u003e\",\"dictationDemoAutoFormatsSubtitle\":\"Your words, perfectly structured\",\"emailGreeting\":\"Hey John,\",\"emailSubGreeting\":\"\",\"emailBody\":\"Thanks for your interest! Here's the demo video: \",\"emailDemoLink\":\"demo video\",\"emailFollowUp\":\"Let me know if you have any questions.\",\"emailPreClosing\":\"\",\"emailClosing\":\"Best,\",\"emailName\":\"Steve\"},\"AgentPage\":{\"metaTitle\":\"AI Voice Agent for Mac and Windows - VoiceOS\",\"metaDescription\":\"Say what you want done and VoiceOS does it across your apps. Send messages, book time, search the web, and connect MCP servers—with confirmation before it acts.\",\"title\":\"Say it, and it \u003caccent\u003egets done\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"subtitle\":\"Agent Mode goes and does the thing. It works inside the apps you already use, and it shows you a confirmation before anything sends.\",\"chip\":\"Mac and Windows\",\"speedSubtitle\":\"The moment you think of it, just say it. VoiceOS takes care of it, without you opening another app.\",\"videoLabel\":\"The VoiceOS Agent Mode film\",\"videoPlay\":\"Play the film\",\"appsTitle\":\"It works \u003caccent\u003ewith your favorite apps\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"appsSubtitle\":\"Say it once and the reply is sent, the event is scheduled, without you opening a single app.\",\"appsPickLabel\":\"Pick an app\",\"sceneSlack\":\"Replies in the thread\",\"sceneGmail\":\"Writes the email and sends it\",\"sceneGcal\":\"Puts it on the calendar\",\"sceneNotion\":\"Adds it to the page\",\"sceneLinear\":\"Files the issue\",\"sceneWeather\":\"Looks it up on the web\",\"confirmTitle\":\"Nothing sends until \u003caccent\u003eyou say so\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"confirmSubtitle\":\"Anything that sends, books, or changes something stops and shows you what it will do. Fix it or let it go.\",\"reachTitle\":\"Plug in \u003caccent\u003eanything you use\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"reachSubtitle\":\"Turn on Slack, Gmail, Notion, Linear and the rest in Settings. After that, just ask out loud and VoiceOS uses them for you. Built your own tool? It can use that too.\",\"reachMcpTitle\":\"Your own MCP server\",\"reachMcpBody\":\"Every tool on it, by voice\",\"reachMcpCmd\":\"voiceos add mcp\",\"bgTitle\":\"Say it and \u003caccent\u003econsider it done\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"bgSubtitle\":\"Long tasks keep running at the side of your screen. The answer comes back on its own.\",\"bgSearch\":\"Search\",\"bgToday\":\"Today, 2:14 PM\",\"bgYesterday\":\"Yesterday, 5:40 PM\",\"bgTask1\":\"Compare flights to Osaka\",\"bgTask2\":\"Summarize the Q3 doc\",\"bgTask3\":\"Draft the recap email\",\"bgTask4\":\"Rename the files on my desktop\",\"bgTask5\":\"Add dinner Thursday to my calendar\",\"bgTask6\":\"Find the Figma invoice\",\"bgTask7\":\"Send Kai the launch notes\",\"bgTask8\":\"Pull the numbers from the Notion doc\",\"bgTask9\":\"Check what is on my calendar tomorrow\",\"bgTask10\":\"Remind me to renew the domain\",\"bgDocTitle\":\"Osaka offsite\",\"bgDocP1\":\"We land Thursday morning, so the team dinner has to be that evening. Kenji offered to book the izakaya near the station.\",\"bgDocP2\":\"Friday is the workshop. Two sessions before lunch, then the demo, then we let people go early.\",\"bgDocP3\":\"Saturday is open. A few people want to stay on, so I will keep the group booking flexible until Wednesday.\",\"bgDocP4\":\"I will lock the hotel in once the flights are\",\"bgWorking\":\"Working in the background\",\"bgNew\":\"New response\"},\"Quote\":{\"text\":\"“Speech is the ultimate natural user interface.”\",\"author\":\"Steve Jobs\"},\"PriceValue\":{\"title\":\"For just \u003cprice\u003e{amount}\u003c/price\u003e a day\",\"subtitle\":\"That is 10x your productivity, for less than a cup of coffee a week.\"},\"Footer\":{\"copyright\":\"Copyright © 2026 WakoAI, Inc. All Rights Reserved.\",\"termsOfService\":\"Terms of Use\",\"privacyPolicy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"security\":\"Security\",\"affiliatePolicy\":\"Affiliate Policy\",\"contact\":\"Contact\",\"affiliates\":\"Affiliates\",\"product\":\"Product\",\"company\":\"Company\",\"compare\":\"Compare\",\"allComparisons\":\"All comparisons\",\"resources\":\"Resources\",\"legal\":\"Legal\",\"pricing\":\"Pricing\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"about\":\"About\",\"team\":\"Team\",\"manifesto\":\"Manifesto\",\"agentMode\":\"Agent Mode\",\"dictationMode\":\"Dictation Mode\",\"appStore\":\"App Store\",\"features\":\"All features\",\"glossary\":\"Voice glossary\",\"changelog\":\"Changelog\",\"documentation\":\"Documentation\"},\"Navbar\":{\"pricing\":\"Pricing\",\"product\":\"Product\",\"features\":\"Features\",\"agentMode\":\"Agent Mode\",\"dictationMode\":\"Dictation Mode\",\"productPricingDesc\":\"Plans, trial, and discounts\",\"productFeaturesDesc\":\"Everything VoiceOS can do\",\"productAgentDesc\":\"Say it, and it gets done\",\"productDictationDesc\":\"Talk instead of typing\",\"blog\":\"Blogs\",\"about\":\"About\",\"team\":\"Team\",\"manifesto\":\"Manifesto\",\"affiliates\":\"Affiliates\",\"download\":\"Download\",\"downloadForMac\":\"Download for Mac\",\"downloadForWindows\":\"Download for Windows\",\"appStore\":\"App Store\"},\"Students\":{\"metaTitle\":\"VoiceOS for Students | 50% off Pro\",\"metaDescription\":\"Verify you're enrolled and keep 50% off Pro for as long as you're a student.\",\"title\":\"VoiceOS for \u003caccent\u003estudents\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"subtitle\":\"Verify you're enrolled. Keep the discount until you graduate.\",\"offerChip\":\"50% off Pro while you're enrolled\",\"optionalLabel\":\"(optional)\",\"nameLabel\":\"Name\",\"namePlaceholder\":\"Ada Lovelace\",\"schoolEmailLabel\":\"School email\",\"schoolEmailHint\":\"(your .edu or university address)\",\"accountEmailLabel\":\"VoiceOS account email\",\"accountEmailHint\":\"(only if it's different from your school email)\",\"schoolLabel\":\"School\",\"schoolPlaceholder\":\"MIT, University of Tokyo, ...\",\"programLabel\":\"What are you studying?\",\"programPlaceholder\":\"Computer science, law, medicine, ...\",\"gradYearLabel\":\"Expected graduation\",\"gradYearPlaceholder\":\"2028\",\"proofLabel\":\"Proof of enrollment\",\"proofHint\":\"(a photo of your student ID or a screenshot of your enrollment page both work)\",\"filePrompt\":\"Upload a photo or PDF\",\"fileReplace\":\"Replace\",\"fileMissing\":\"Please add your proof of enrollment.\",\"fileTooLarge\":\"That file is over 8MB. Please pick a smaller photo or PDF.\",\"fileUnsupported\":\"That file type didn't work. A JPG, PNG, HEIC, or PDF is perfect.\",\"tooManyAttempts\":\"Too many applications from this connection. Please try again in an hour.\",\"usageLabel\":\"What will you use VoiceOS for?\",\"usagePlaceholder\":\"Lecture notes, essays, coding assignments, ...\",\"dictatedLabel\":\"Bonus points: I dictated this application.\",\"submit\":\"Apply\",\"submitting\":\"Sending...\",\"invalidEmail\":\"That email doesn't look right.\",\"errorGeneric\":\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\",\"successTitle\":\"Application received.\",\"successBody\":\"We check every one. If you're verified, the discount lands in your inbox within a few days.\",\"renewalNote\":\"We re-check enrollment once a year. The discount rides along until you graduate.\",\"backToHome\":\"Back to home\"},\"AskAI\":{\"heading\":\"Still not sure? Ask your AI.\",\"askProvider\":\"Ask {provider}\"},\"AppStore\":{\"metaTitle\":\"VoiceOS App Store — Official Integrations\",\"metaDescription\":\"Browse every official VoiceOS integration — Gmail, Slack, Notion, iMessage, and more — and see every action each one can take by voice.\",\"heroEyebrow\":\"App Store\",\"heroTitleLine1\":\"The app ecosystem\",\"heroTitleLine2\":\"powered by voice\",\"heroSubtitle\":\"Official integrations, built into VoiceOS and maintained by us. Connect the apps you live in, then just say what you want done.\",\"viewBuildGuide\":\"Read the build guide\",\"filter_all\":\"All\",\"submitEyebrow\":\"Publish on the App Store\",\"submitTitle\":\"Got an integration to share?\",\"submitSubtitle\":\"Publish your integration to the VoiceOS App Store.\",\"nameLabel\":\"Integration name\",\"namePlaceholder\":\"Integration name\",\"emailLabel\":\"Your email\",\"emailPlaceholder\":\"Your email\",\"repoLabel\":\"Link (optional)\",\"repoPlaceholder\":\"Link to the code or a demo (optional)\",\"descriptionLabel\":\"What does it do?\",\"descriptionPlaceholder\":\"What does it do? Which apps it controls, what you can say to it, and why VoiceOS users would want it.\",\"submitButton\":\"Apply to publish\",\"submitting\":\"Submitting...\",\"submitSuccessTitle\":\"Submission received\",\"submitSuccessBody\":\"Thanks for sharing your integration. We will review it and reach out if we need anything else.\",\"invalidEmail\":\"Enter a valid email address.\",\"invalidRepo\":\"That link doesn't look right — include https://\",\"requiredFields\":\"Add a name, your email, and what it does.\",\"submitError\":\"We could not submit this integration. Please try again.\",\"reviewNote\":\"Reviewed by hand before anything is listed.\",\"category_messages\":\"Messaging\",\"category_email\":\"Email\",\"category_calendar\":\"Calendar\",\"category_productivity\":\"Productivity\",\"category_noteTaking\":\"Note Taking\",\"category_media\":\"Media\",\"category_social\":\"Social\",\"badgeBeta\":\"Beta\",\"badgeMacOnly\":\"macOS only\",\"toolCountLabel\":\"{count, plural, one {# voice action} other {# voice actions}}\",\"platformMac\":\"macOS\",\"platformMacWindows\":\"macOS · Windows\",\"backToAppStore\":\"All integrations\",\"detailMetaTitle\":\"{name} voice control — {count, plural, one {# voice action} other {# voice actions}} | VoiceOS\",\"detailMetaDescription\":\"{name} by voice with VoiceOS: {summary}. Every voice action, which confirm first, and how to connect it.\",\"detailCtaButton\":\"Download VoiceOS\",\"faqEyebrow\":\"FAQ\",\"faqTitle\":\"Questions we get asked\",\"faq_apps_q\":\"Which apps can VoiceOS connect to?\",\"faq_apps_a\":\"{integrationCount} official integrations ship inside VoiceOS, covering messaging, email, calendars, productivity tools, note taking, media and social. Together they add up to {toolCount} separate voice actions. We build and maintain every one of them, so none of this rests on a third-party plugin that stops working next month.\",\"faq_slack_q\":\"How do I use Slack with my voice?\",\"faq_slack_a\":\"Connect Slack once in the VoiceOS app, then just say what you want. You can send a message, schedule one for later, search your history, find a channel or a person, open a DM, react, set a reminder, or upload a file. Say \\\"tell the design channel the build is ready\\\" and VoiceOS writes it, then shows you the message before it posts.\",\"faq_meeting_q\":\"Can I book a meeting with my voice?\",\"faq_meeting_a\":\"Yes, through Google Calendar or Apple Calendar. VoiceOS can create an event, block out a full day, move or cancel something, read your schedule back to you, and find open time before it books anything. \\\"Find thirty minutes on Thursday afternoon and put it on my calendar\\\" is one sentence instead of six clicks.\",\"faq_siri_q\":\"Is VoiceOS a good Siri alternative?\",\"faq_siri_a\":\"They are built for different jobs. Siri is strongest on phone-sized tasks and system settings. VoiceOS works inside the desktop apps you actually get work done in, with {toolCount} concrete actions across {integrationCount} of them, and it will dictate into any text field on your Mac. If you have ever asked Siri to send a Slack message or move a meeting and hit a wall, that is the gap this fills.\",\"faq_setup_q\":\"Do I have to set up each app before it works?\",\"faq_setup_a\":\"Cloud apps like Gmail, Slack, Notion and Linear ask you to sign in once and then remember it. The Apple apps go through macOS permissions instead, so you approve access the first time VoiceOS reaches for them and never again.\",\"faq_windows_q\":\"Do all of these work on Windows?\",\"faq_windows_a\":\"Not all of them. {macOnlyCount} are macOS only, because they drive native Apple apps such as iMessage, Apple Mail, Reminders, Notes and Finder. The cloud integrations run on both, including Gmail, Slack, Notion, Jira, Linear and Google Drive. Every listing on this page says which.\",\"faq_confirm_q\":\"Will it send things without asking me first?\",\"faq_confirm_a\":\"Most actions that write something stop and confirm. Posting to Slack or uploading a file shows you what is about to happen first. Reading and searching simply answer you. A few integrations where confirming every time would only get in the way, like Spotify and Google Maps, act straight away. Each integration page marks exactly which of its actions ask first.\",\"faq_missing_q\":\"What if the app I use is not listed?\",\"faq_missing_a\":\"You can still wire it up yourself. VoiceOS speaks MCP, so any MCP server you point it at becomes a set of voice actions, and the build guide walks through it. If you would rather we ship it as an official integration, there is a form at the bottom of this page.\",\"factsVersion\":\"Version\",\"factsVersionCaption\":\"Built in\",\"factsDeveloper\":\"Developer\",\"factsDeveloperCaption\":\"First-party\",\"factsTools\":\"Tools\",\"factsToolsCaption\":\"voice actions\",\"factsCategory\":\"Category\",\"factsPlatforms\":\"Platforms\",\"samplesTitle\":\"Try saying\",\"setupTitle\":\"Getting started\",\"step1Title\":\"Download VoiceOS\",\"step1Body\":\"Free to start, on Mac and Windows.\",\"step2Title\":\"Connect {name}\",\"step2Body\":\"One click in the dashboard's Integrations tab.\",\"step3Title\":\"Just say it\",\"step3Body\":\"Speak — VoiceOS does the rest.\",\"connectionCloudNote\":\"Connects to your {name} account — you sign in with {name} in your browser, and VoiceOS never sees your password.\",\"connectionNativeNote\":\"Runs locally on your Mac — nothing to sign into, and your data stays on your device.\",\"permissionFullDisk\":\"macOS will ask for Full Disk Access when you connect — it's how VoiceOS reads your messages on this Mac.\",\"permissionAutomation\":\"macOS will ask permission for VoiceOS to control Spotify the first time you use it.\",\"canvasSetupNote\":\"Canvas needs an access token from your school account — VoiceOS walks you through creating one when you connect.\",\"jiraWorkspaceNote\":\"Your connection is bound to one Atlassian workspace, shown on the integration card so you always know where actions run.\",\"confirmationBody\":\"VoiceOS asks you to confirm before it sends, changes, or deletes anything — every action marked “Asks first” below.\",\"noConfirmationBody\":\"These actions are safe and easy to undo, so VoiceOS runs them right away — no confirmation needed.\",\"toolsTitle\":\"What it can do\",\"toolsSubtitle\":\"What Agent Mode can do with this integration.\",\"asksFirst\":\"Asks first\",\"asksFirstHint\":\"VoiceOS confirms with you before this runs.\",\"relatedTitle\":\"More from the App Store\"},\"ProductHuntBanner\":{\"message\":\"We're live on Product Hunt!\",\"cta\":\"Support us\",\"dismiss\":\"Dismiss\"},\"AppActions\":{\"struckTitle\":\"Speech-to-text\",\"title\":\"Voice-to-action\",\"subtitle\":\"Send the email, file the ticket, schedule the meeting. Say it once and VoiceOS does it in the right app.\",\"email\":\"Send an email\",\"slack\":\"Reply to Maya\",\"calendar\":\"Schedule a meeting\",\"finder\":\"Find that PDF\",\"notion\":\"Take a note\",\"imessage\":\"Text Mom\",\"linear\":\"File a bug\",\"chrome\":\"Search the web\",\"drive\":\"Open the roadmap\",\"docs\":\"Draft a proposal\",\"obsidian\":\"Add a daily note\"},\"StopScreenshots\":{\"caption\":\"Can you find his LinkedIn\",\"title\":\"Point anywhere on your screen.\",\"subtitle\":\"Stop taking screenshots. VoiceOS sees what your cursor is on and answers instantly. No copy-paste.\"},\"StopLooking\":{\"caption\":\"Search for last year's tax returns\",\"title\":\"Stop looking for {item}\",\"itemFile\":\"that file\",\"itemEmail\":\"that email\",\"itemDoc\":\"that doc\",\"itemNote\":\"that note\",\"subtitle\":\"You know exactly what you're looking for. You just don't know where it is. Ask, and VoiceOS pulls it up in seconds.\"},\"ProductivityGraph\":{\"title\":\"Not just another dictation app\",\"subtitle\":\"Dictation only speeds up your typing. VoiceOS multiplies your productivity.\",\"axisLabel\":\"Productivity\",\"crestLabel\":\"your productivity\",\"seriesTyping\":\"Typing\",\"seriesDictation\":\"Dictation\",\"seriesVoiceos\":\"VoiceOS\",\"tableCaption\":\"Relative productivity of typing, dictation, and VoiceOS\"},\"Builders\":{\"metaTitle\":\"VoiceOS for Builders | 50% off Pro\",\"metaDescription\":\"Show us what you're building with VoiceOS and get 50% off Pro for your first 3 months.\",\"title\":\"VoiceOS for \u003caccent\u003ebuilders\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"subtitle\":\"Show us what you're building with VoiceOS.\",\"offerChip\":\"50% off Pro for your first 3 months\",\"optionalLabel\":\"(optional)\",\"nameLabel\":\"Name\",\"namePlaceholder\":\"Ada Lovelace\",\"emailLabel\":\"Email\",\"emailHint\":\"(the one on your VoiceOS account)\",\"workflowLabel\":\"What workflow are you building with VoiceOS?\",\"workflowPlaceholder\":\"Dictating specs into Linear, triaging email by voice, voice-driving your editor...\",\"integrationsLabel\":\"Integrations you've made\",\"integrationsPlaceholder\":\"Notion, Spotify, your own MCP server...\",\"integrationsNextLabel\":\"Integrations you want next\",\"integrationsNextPlaceholder\":\"The tools you wish VoiceOS could drive...\",\"linkLabel\":\"Show us. One link.\",\"linkHint\":\"(a 60 second screen recording of your workflow is the fastest way to a yes)\",\"linkPlaceholder\":\"https://\",\"dictatedLabel\":\"Bonus points: I dictated this application.\",\"submit\":\"Apply\",\"submitting\":\"Sending...\",\"invalidEmail\":\"That email doesn't look right.\",\"invalidLink\":\"That link doesn't look right.\",\"tooManyAttempts\":\"Too many applications from this connection. Please try again in an hour.\",\"errorGeneric\":\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\",\"successTitle\":\"Application received.\",\"successBody\":\"We read every single one. If you're in, the discount lands in your inbox within a few days.\",\"backToHome\":\"Back to home\"},\"TimeSavings\":{\"caption\":\"Email him for honest feedback about VoiceOS\",\"title\":\"Point anywhere on your screen.\",\"subtitle\":\"Your cursor is the context. No more explaining, just point and ask.\",\"stepUnit\":\"step\",\"spokenRequest\":\"Hey VoiceOS, do I have any meetings today?\"},\"FAQ\":{\"title\":\"Questions?\",\"q1\":\"How is VoiceOS different from traditional speech recognition?\",\"a1\":\"VoiceOS uses advanced AI to go beyond basic speech-to-text. While Mac Dictation transcribes exactly what you say (including 'um' and 'uh'), VoiceOS \u003cstrong\u003eautomatically removes filler words\u003c/strong\u003e, fixes grammar, and formats your text professionally. It's like having an \u003cstrong\u003eeditor built in\u003c/strong\u003e, perfect for emails, documents, and messaging.\",\"q2\":\"Is my data private and secure with VoiceOS?\",\"a2\":\"Absolutely. VoiceOS processes your audio in real time and \u003cstrong\u003enever stores it\u003c/strong\u003e unless you give permission to help improve the product. Your transcripts are \u003cstrong\u003esaved locally on your device\u003c/strong\u003e, giving you full control over them. None of your data is used for training or shared with anyone. Privacy and security are built into everything we do.\",\"q3\":\"What apps does VoiceOS work with?\",\"a3\":\"VoiceOS works seamlessly across \u003cstrong\u003eyour favorite apps\u003c/strong\u003e like Gmail, Slack, Notion, Google Docs, iMessage, WhatsApp, and more. Whether you're writing code in Cursor, chatting in Messenger, or drafting in Obsidian, VoiceOS is there to help you \u003cstrong\u003ecommunicate faster\u003c/strong\u003e.\"},\"AgentModeDemo\":{\"badge\":\"Coming 4/3\",\"title\":\"Agent Mode\",\"subtitle\":\"Voice to Actions across integrated apps. Zero context switching.\",\"scenarioSlack\":\"Slack: draft reply in-channel\",\"scenarioGmail\":\"Gmail: compose \u0026 send\",\"scenarioGcal\":\"Google Calendar: new event\",\"scenarioNotion\":\"Notion: create page\",\"scenarioLinear\":\"Linear: create issue\",\"scenarioWeather\":\"Web search: weather\"},\"Pricing\":{\"title\":\"Pricing\",\"subtitle\":\"Start with a \u003cbold\u003e7-day free trial\u003c/bold\u003e, cancel anytime\",\"monthly\":\"Monthly\",\"annual\":\"Annual\",\"saveBadge\":\"Save {percent}%\",\"free\":\"Free\",\"pro\":\"Pro\",\"enterprise\":\"Enterprise\",\"forever\":\"forever\",\"perMonth\":\"per month\",\"noCreditCard\":\"no credit card required\",\"billedAnnually\":\"billed annually\",\"billedMonthly\":\"billed monthly\",\"custom\":\"Custom\",\"freeDescription\":\"Perfect for trying out VoiceOS\",\"enterpriseDescription\":\"For teams and organizations\",\"freeLimit\":\"100 usage / week\",\"proLimit\":\"Unlimited usage\",\"getStarted\":\"Get Started\",\"goPro\":\"Go Pro\",\"contactSales\":\"Contact Sales\",\"featureDictation\":\"\u003cbold\u003eDictation \u003c/bold\u003eMode\",\"featureAsk\":\"\u003cbold\u003eAgent \u003c/bold\u003eMode\",\"featureVocabulary\":\"\u003cbold\u003eCustom\u003c/bold\u003e vocabulary\",\"featureApps\":\"\u003cbold\u003eWorks\u003c/bold\u003e in every app\",\"featureEverythingFree\":\"\u003cbold\u003eEverything\u003c/bold\u003e in Free\",\"featureUnlimited\":\"\u003cbold\u003eUnlimited\u003c/bold\u003e usage\",\"featurePriority\":\"\u003cbold\u003ePriority\u003c/bold\u003e support\",\"featureTeam\":\"\u003cbold\u003eTeam\u003c/bold\u003e features\",\"featureEverythingPro\":\"\u003cbold\u003eEverything\u003c/bold\u003e in Pro\",\"featureZeroRetention\":\"\u003cbold\u003eZero\u003c/bold\u003e data retention\",\"featureSoc2\":\"\u003cbold\u003eSecurity\u003c/bold\u003e review support\",\"featureSso\":\"\u003cbold\u003eSSO / SAML\u003c/bold\u003e — contact sales\",\"buildersOfferLead\":\"Builders\",\"buildersOfferCta\":\"apply for 50% off Pro\",\"studentOfferLead\":\"Students\",\"studentOfferCta\":\"get 50% off Pro\",\"pageTitle\":\"Start with 7 days free\",\"pageSubtitle\":\"Full Pro access for a week. A card is required, and you can cancel any time before the trial ends.\",\"freeTrialIncluded\":\"7-day free trial included\"},\"Waitlist\":{\"joinWaitlist\":\"Join our waitlist\",\"beFirst\":\"Be the first to experience VoiceOS\",\"onTheList\":\"You're on the list!\",\"notify\":\"We'll notify you when VoiceOS is ready for you.\",\"enterEmail\":\"Enter your email\",\"joinButton\":\"Join Waitlist\",\"processing\":\"Processing...\",\"failedToJoin\":\"Failed to join waitlist. Please try again.\",\"errorOccurred\":\"An error occurred. Please try again.\"},\"StayOnTask\":{\"caption\":\"Remind me to send Maya the deck\",\"title\":\"Agent keeps you on task.\",\"subtitle\":\"Say it once and let it go. VoiceOS keeps track of the task and brings it back at the right time, so nothing sits in your head.\",\"spokenRequest\":\"Hey VoiceOS, remind me in 2 hours to send Maya the deck\",\"screenAlt\":\"A VoiceOS reminder card on a Mac desktop, with the notch listening above it\",\"cardTask\":\"Send Maya the deck\",\"cardTime\":\"Today, 4:00 PM\"},\"Languages\":{\"titleLine1\":\"Works in over\",\"titleLine2\":\"\u003cbold\u003e100+ languages\u003c/bold\u003e\",\"subtitle\":\"\u003cbold\u003eAutomatically detects\u003c/bold\u003e language. No switching required.\",\"english\":\"English\",\"spanish\":\"Spanish\",\"french\":\"French\",\"german\":\"German\",\"italian\":\"Italian\",\"portuguese\":\"Portuguese\",\"japanese\":\"Japanese\",\"hindi\":\"Hindi\",\"dutch\":\"Dutch\",\"swedish\":\"Swedish\",\"norwegian\":\"Norwegian\",\"danish\":\"Danish\",\"finnish\":\"Finnish\",\"polish\":\"Polish\",\"greek\":\"Greek\",\"turkish\":\"Turkish\",\"thai\":\"Thai\",\"vietnamese\":\"Vietnamese\",\"indonesian\":\"Indonesian\"},\"Privacy\":{\"titleLine1\":\"What you say\",\"titleLine2\":\"stays yours\",\"description\":\"Your audio is never stored on our servers and never used to train models. You decide what leaves your Mac.\",\"learnMore\":\"Learn more\",\"toggleLabel\":\"Privacy mode\",\"switchLabel\":\"Privacy\",\"tabGeneral\":\"General\",\"tabPrivacy\":\"Privacy\",\"tabProfiles\":\"Profiles\",\"tabAdvanced\":\"Advanced\",\"onDevice\":\"On your device\",\"keepTranscriptsLocal\":\"Save transcripts on this device\",\"processAudioRealtime\":\"Don't save audio in the cloud\",\"noTrainingUse\":\"Never use my dictation to train AI models\",\"optionalSharing\":\"Optional sharing\",\"shareDiagnostics\":\"Send anonymous diagnostics and crash reports\",\"shareDiagnosticsNote\":\"Never includes raw audio or full transcripts tied to you.\"},\"WallOfLove\":{\"titleHead\":\"Wall of \",\"titleTail\":\"Love\",\"subtitle\":\"Founders, creators, and builders are replacing typing with VoiceOS.\",\"joinThem\":\"Join Them\",\"joinCount\":\"20,000+ voicepilled\",\"joinAria\":\"Join 20,000+ VoiceOS users\",\"carouselAria\":\"VoiceOS testimonials carousel\",\"viewPostAria\":\"View {name}'s original post\",\"avatarAlt\":\"{name} avatar\",\"gabePerezName\":\"Gabe Perez\",\"gabePerezRole\":\"Head of Product Curation, Product Hunt\",\"gabePerezQuote\":\"VoiceOS lets me get work done 10x faster. I do everything with voice nowadays. The experience will change your life.\",\"andreyName\":\"Andrey\",\"andreyRole\":\"AI enthusiast, NVIDIA GTC winner\",\"andreyQuote\":\"Tried out all the voice productivity tools. VoiceOS is the one I ended up sticking with. It's just the best.\",\"yoichiOchiaiName\":\"Yoichi Ochiai\",\"yoichiOchiaiRole\":\"Media Artist, 605k followers\",\"yoichiOchiaiQuote\":\"I started using VoiceOS.\",\"usutakuName\":\"Usutaku\",\"usutakuRole\":\"#1 Japanese AI Influencer\",\"usutakuQuote\":\"I tried VoiceOS right away, and it was faster and a better experience than any voice input tool I've used before!\",\"souLabName\":\"sou-lab\",\"souLabRole\":\"VoiceOS user\",\"souLabQuote\":\"I sent VoiceOS some feedback, and they added the feature the very next day. Unreal.\",\"albyChurvenName\":\"Alby Churven\",\"albyChurvenRole\":\"14 y/o CMO\",\"albyChurvenQuote\":\"I was using WisprFlow for 3 days and just switched to VoiceOS. VoiceOS is genuinely crazy.\",\"akiraName\":\"akira\",\"akiraRole\":\"Founder of Random Labs, agent harness researcher\",\"akiraQuote\":\"Using VoiceOS for this and it's so smooth lets fucking go. Coding agents + dictation is an insane combo.\",\"emanuelPerezName\":\"Emanuel Perez\",\"emanuelPerezRole\":\"Operations Manager\",\"emanuelPerezQuote\":\"Big fan of agent mode on VoiceOS. This wasn't doable on other apps and makes things like replying to emails much faster.\",\"reneGrywnowName\":\"René Grywnow\",\"reneGrywnowRole\":\"Founder and operations lead\",\"reneGrywnowQuote\":\"VoiceOS: Just speak.\\n\\nNo setup. No excuse.\\n\\nThe future does not type. She speaks.\"},\"FeaturesPage\":{\"metaTitle\":\"Features - VoiceOS\",\"metaDescription\":\"Everything VoiceOS does. Agent Mode turns your voice into actions across apps, while Dictation Mode turns speech into polished writing on Mac and Windows.\",\"title\":\"Do more with your \u003caccent\u003evoice\u003c/accent\u003e\",\"subtitle\":\"VoiceOS turns what you say into real actions across the apps you already use. Dictation is built in.\",\"chip\":\"Mac and Windows\",\"hubAgentEyebrow\":\"Agent Mode\",\"hubAgentTitle\":\"Say it, and it gets done\",\"hubAgentBody\":\"Ask out loud and VoiceOS does the work inside your apps. It sends the message, books the time, finds the file, checks the web. Anything that sends or changes something shows you a confirmation first.\",\"hubDictationEyebrow\":\"Dictation Mode\",\"hubDictationTitle\":\"Talk instead of typing\",\"hubDictationBody\":\"Speak anywhere you would otherwise type, in any app, in 100 languages. The filler comes out, the spelling gets fixed, and what lands on the page is what you meant.\",\"hubCta\":\"See what it does\",\"agentTitle\":\"Agent Mode\",\"agentSubtitle\":\"Say what you want done. VoiceOS goes and does it.\",\"agentF1Title\":\"Actions across your apps\",\"agentF1Body\":\"Send the message, create the issue, add the calendar event. You talk, VoiceOS does the clicking.\",\"agentF2Title\":\"Integrations you connect\",\"agentF2Body\":\"Notion, Slack, Gmail, Linear, Spotify and more. Connect them once in Settings and they answer to your voice.\",\"agentF3Title\":\"Your own MCP servers\",\"agentF3Body\":\"Point VoiceOS at any MCP server and every tool it exposes becomes something you can just ask for.\",\"agentF4Title\":\"Web search with sources\",\"agentF4Body\":\"Ask a question out loud, get a real answer back with the sources it came from.\",\"agentF5Title\":\"Screen awareness\",\"agentF5Body\":\"Ask about whatever is in front of you. Screen access stays behind a toggle that you own.\",\"agentF6Title\":\"Reminders and scheduling\",\"agentF6Body\":\"Ask for a nudge later and VoiceOS brings it back to you at the right moment.\",\"agentF7Title\":\"It asks before it acts\",\"agentF7Body\":\"Anything that sends, books, or changes something shows you a confirmation card first.\",\"agentAskLabel\":\"You say\",\"agentAskSentence\":\"Tell David I'll be ten minutes late, and move our 3pm to Thursday\",\"agentDone1\":\"Message sent\",\"agentDone2\":\"Moved to Thursday\",\"agentConfirmLabel\":\"Before it sends\",\"agentConfirmAction\":\"Send message\",\"agentConfirmToLabel\":\"To\",\"agentConfirmToValue\":\"David Chen\",\"agentConfirmMsgLabel\":\"Message\",\"agentConfirmMsgText\":\"I'll be ten minutes late. Can we move our 3pm to Thursday?\",\"agentConfirmCancel\":\"Cancel\",\"agentConfirmSend\":\"Send\",\"dictationTitle\":\"Dictation Mode\",\"dictSpeedSlowLabel\":\"Keyboard\",\"dictSpeedSlowValue\":\"55 wpm\",\"dictSpeedFastLabel\":\"VoiceOS\",\"dictSpeedFastValue\":\"220 wpm\",\"dictSpeedSentence\":\"I'm getting started with the project. There are three things I need: repo access, the design files, and a staging key.\",\"dictSpeedTyped\":\"I'm getting started with the |porject|(project). There are three things I need: repo access, the |desgin|(design) files, and a staging key.\",\"dictSpeedListLead\":\"I'm getting started with the project. There are three things I need:\",\"dictSpeedListItem1\":\"Repo access\",\"dictSpeedListItem2\":\"The design files\",\"dictSpeedListItem3\":\"A staging key\",\"dictEditsRawLabel\":\"What you said\",\"dictEditsRaw\":\"\u003cfillerMark\u003eso um\u003c/fillerMark\u003e can you take a look at the onboarding bug on the mobile app, there's like three separate things going wrong with it, \u003cname\u003ePreya\u003c/name\u003e's fix from last night did not take, the magic link still lands in spam, \u003cfiller\u003euh\u003c/filler\u003e and the \u003ctypo\u003ePostgress\u003c/typo\u003e logs are full of timeouts, so let's move standup to ten.\",\"dictEditsMarkFiller\":\"Removed filler\",\"dictEditsMarkDict\":\"Added to dictionary\",\"dictEditsMarkSpelling\":\"Fixed spelling\",\"dictEditsNameFixed\":\"Priya\",\"dictEditsTypoFixed\":\"Postgres\",\"dictEditsCleanLead\":\"Can you take a look at the onboarding bug on the mobile app? Three separate things are going wrong with it:\",\"dictEditsCleanItem1\":\"Priya's fix from last night did not take.\",\"dictEditsCleanItem2\":\"The magic link still lands in spam.\",\"dictEditsCleanItem3\":\"The Postgres logs are full of timeouts.\",\"dictEditsCleanTail\":\"Let's move standup to ten.\",\"privacyStatHeadline\":\"\u003cnumber\u003e1,169,420\u003c/number\u003e hours saved for our users\",\"ctaTitle\":\"See it on your own machine\",\"ctaBody\":\"Seven days of Pro, on Mac and Windows.\"},\"Hero\":{\"backedBy\":\"Backed by\",\"combinator\":\"Combinator\",\"headline\":\"Voice assistant\\nat your fingertips\",\"description\":\"Get answers anywhere. Instantly\",\"downloadForMac\":\"Download for Mac\",\"downloadForWindows\":\"Download for Windows\",\"downloadOnDesktop\":\"Download on Desktop\",\"trustedBy\":\"Trusted by 10,000+ users\",\"trialNote\":\"7-day free trial · Cancel anytime\"}},\"now\":\"$undefined\",\"timeZone\":\"UTC\",\"children\":\"$L3a\"}]\n29:[\"$\",\"$L39\",null,{\"formats\":\"$undefined\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"messages\":{\"Navbar\":\"$3:props:messages:Navbar\",\"Footer\":\"$3:props:messages:Footer\",\"MobilePage\":\"$3:props:messages:MobilePage\",\"CTA\":\"$3:props:messages:CTA\"},\"now\":\"$undefined\",\"timeZone\":\"UTC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center bg-[#f9f9f9] px-6 text-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-lg\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#1f6fe0]\",\"children\":\"404\"}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-950\",\"children\":\"Page not found\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"This page may have moved. Head home or browse the VoiceOS blog.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 flex justify-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full bg-gray-950 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white\",\"href\":\"/\",\"children\":\"Go home\"}],[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full border border-gray-300 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900\",\"href\":\"/blog\",\"children\":\"Read the blog\"}]]}]]}]}],[]],\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"$8\",null,{\"fallback\":null,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]\nc:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"theme-color\",\"content\":\"#FFFFFF\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"color-scheme\",\"content\":\"light\"}]]\n3c:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2kb52na2e7ces.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1xfsu92iq1h9m.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3x6-_ejf1r1x0.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n9:null\ne:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Features - VoiceOS\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Everything VoiceOS does. Agent Mode turns your voice into actions across apps, while Dictation Mode turns speech into polished writing on Mac and Windows.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.json\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/features\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"4\",{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"hrefLang\":\"en\",\"href\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/features\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"5\",{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"hrefLang\":\"ja\",\"href\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/ja/features\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"6\",{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"hrefLang\":\"x-default\",\"href\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/features\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"name\":\"google-site-verification\",\"content\":\"uFUtX2rdWjK_rXafEbA9qRvv_m7amTpZJMnUywraMXg\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Features - VoiceOS\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Everything VoiceOS does. Agent Mode turns your voice into actions across apps, while Dictation Mode turns speech into polished writing on Mac and Windows.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/features\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"og:site_name\",\"content\":\"VoiceOS\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"og:locale\",\"content\":\"en_US\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/voiceOsOpenGraph.png\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"property\":\"og:image:width\",\"content\":\"1200\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"property\":\"og:image:height\",\"content\":\"630\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"Features - VoiceOS\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"17\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"website\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"18\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"19\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Features - VoiceOS\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"20\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Everything VoiceOS does. Agent Mode turns your voice into actions across apps, while Dictation Mode turns speech into polished writing on Mac and Windows.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"21\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://www.voiceos.com/voiceOsTwitter.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"22\",{\"rel\":\"shortcut icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"23\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\",\"sizes\":\"16x16 32x32 48x48 64x64 128x128 256x256\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"24\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.png\",\"sizes\":\"96x96\",\"type\":\"image/png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"25\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/apple-touch-icon.png\",\"sizes\":\"180x180\",\"type\":\"image/png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",\"26\",{}]]\n"])</script></body></html>